ane as disciplinas competitivas de <strong>Canicross<\/strong>, <strong>Bikejoring<\/strong> (Open e N\u00f3rdico), <strong>Scooterjoring DS2<\/strong> (Open e N\u00f3rdico) e <strong>Triciclo DR4<\/strong> (Open e N\u00f3rdico), acompanhadas pelos escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o de <strong>Canicross Infantil<\/strong> (6 aos 10 anos e 11 aos 16 anos) e pelas vertentes de lazer de <strong>C\u00e3ominhada<\/strong> e <strong>Caminhada (sem c\u00e3o)<\/strong> pelos estrad\u00f5es e trilhos da Herdade do Espor\u00e3o.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>GD Piranhas do Alqueva<\/strong>, a prova estreia-se no calend\u00e1rio nacional de mushing aliando a competi\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva ao patrim\u00f3nio natural de Reguengos de Monsaraz. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid 